<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/july-16">16 July</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">The Byzantines defeat Tsar Samuel's Bulgarians at the Spercheios</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">A Byzantine army under General Nikephoros Ouranos defeated the Bulgarian army of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tsar">Tsar</a> Samuel on the Spercheios river near Lamia in central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/greece">Greece</a>. The victory virtually destroyed the Bulgarian army and ended its raids in the southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/balkans">Balkans</a> and Greece.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-spercheios" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-spercheios.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-spercheios">Battle of the Spercheios</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of the Spercheios was fought in 997 on the river Spercheios in central Greece.</p></div></li></ol></section>
